/-- **Basis-independence of the metric trace.** For any finite basis `e` of `V`, the trace of the
raised Ricci endomorphism is the diagonal coordinate sum; hence any two bases give the same
scalar curvature. -/
theorem scalarMetricTrace_eq_sum_basis (e : Module.Basis κ ℝ V) :
    D.scalarMetricTrace = ∑ i : κ, e.repr (D.metric.raiseIndex D.ricciForm (e i)) i := by
  rw [scalarMetricTrace]
