/-- **Reduction of the scalar variation to the trace-commutation dependency.** If the Ricci form
has derivative `Ricdot`, then the scalar curvature has derivative the frame trace of `Ricdot`.
The only inputs are the trace-commutation hypothesis and the finite orthonormal-basis expansion
